{"id":"vod_bf_7300","vodId":"7300","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"吊带袜天使","name_cn":"吊带袜天使","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-8/292cba18d4f1f3b10992cf734a9adae5.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一座名为堕天城的城市之中，它夹在天堂和地狱之间，是一座充满了危险和奇遇的城市。近日来，城市里出现了邪恶的恶灵，他们依靠袭击市民们为生，这令市民们人心惶惶人人自危。　　Panty（小笠原亚里沙 配音）和Stocking（伊濑茉莉也 配音）本是两位天使，却因为他们桀骜不驯的作风而被逐出了天堂，来到了堕天城。在这里，姐妹两人遇见了名为Garterbelt（石井康嗣 配音）的神父，在这位拥有着神秘过去的神父的带领下，Panty和Stocking成为了恶灵狩猎者，通过狩猎恶灵得到天堂金币，当天堂金币积攒到了一定的数量之时，Panty和Stocking便可以借此重新返回天堂。就这样，两人在堕天城的日常就此拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:05:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/diaodaiwatianshi/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026